"or manually set the :guilabel:`Journal` of the self-bill to the self-billing "
"purchase journal."
msgstr ""
"Self-bill は、:ref:`手動 <accounting/vendor_bills/creation-manual>`\\ でも"
"\\ :ref:`自動 <accounting/vendor_bills/automatic>`\\ でも作成できます。Self-"
"bill を作成する際は、:guilabel:`会計ダッシュボード`\\ 上の\\ :ref:`Self-"
"billing 購買仕訳帳 <accounting/vendor_bills/self-billing-config>`\\ から直接"
"作成するか、Self-bill の\\ :guilabel:`仕訳帳`\\ を Self-billing 購買仕訳帳に"
"手動で設定してください。"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:164
msgid ""
"The sequence of self-bills contains the :ref:`database ID "
