#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:40
msgid ""
"Odoo collects activity data from journal entries posted to expense and asset "
"accounts. These include:"
msgstr ""
"Odooは、経費および資産分析勘定に転記された仕訳帳エントリから活動データを収集"
"します。これには次のものが含まれます："

#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:43
msgid "Fixed assets"
msgstr "固定資産"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:44
#: ../../content/applications/finance/expenses.rst:5
msgid "Expenses"
msgstr "費用"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:45
