#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/guatemala.rst:42
msgid ""
"**SAT**: *Superintendencia de Administración Tributaria* is the government "
"entity responsible for enforcing tax payments in Guatemala."
msgstr ""
"**SAT**: *Superintendencia de Administración Tributaria* は、グアテマラで税金"
"の支払いを執行する政府機関です。"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/guatemala.rst:44
msgid ""
"**FEL**: *Factura Electrónica en Línea* is the electronic invoicing system "
"mandated by the SAT in Guatemala, which requires businesses to issue and "
"manage electronic documents in compliance with local regulations."
msgstr ""
"**FEL**: *Factura Electrónica en Línea* は、グアテマラのSATによって義務付けら"
"れている電子請求システムであり、企業が現地の規制に準拠して電子ドキュメントを"
"発行・管理することを求めています。"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/guatemala.rst:47
#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/uruguay.rst:39
msgid ""
"**EDI**: *Electronic Data Interchange* refers to the sending of electronic "
"documents."
msgstr ""
"**EDI**: *Electronic Data Interchange* は、電子ドキュメントの送信を指します。"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/guatemala.rst:48
msgid ""
"**Infile**: is the third-party organization that facilitates the interchange "
"of electronic documents between companies and the Guatemalan government."
msgstr ""
"**Infile**: 企業とグアテマラ政府間の電子ドキュメントの交換を促進する第三者機"
"関です。"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/guatemala.rst:50
msgid ""
"**UUID**: *Universally Unique Identifier* is a unique alphanumeric code "
"assigned by the SAT to each certified electronic document in the FEL system, "
"used for traceability and official validation."
msgstr ""
"**UUID**\\ ：\\ *Universally Unique Identifier*\\ は、SATがFELシステム内の各"
"認証済み電子ドキュメントに割り当てる一意の英数字コードで、追跡可能性と公式検"
"証に使用されます。"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/guatemala.rst:53
msgid ""
"**Phrases**: Type of Phrases with specific Scenario Codes are used in the "
"Guatemalan localization to comply with the requirements of the SAT. They "
"should be added depending on the issuer regime, receiver, and operation "
"type. These phrases are used in the XML and PDF documents."
msgstr ""
"**フレーズ**\\ ：特定のシナリオコードを持つフレーズの種類は、グアテマラローカ"
"ライゼーションでSATの要件に準拠するために使用されます。発行者の体制、受取人、"
"および操作タイプに応じて追加する必要があります。これらのフレーズはXMLおよび"
"PDFドキュメントで使用されます。"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/guatemala.rst:56
msgid ""
"**Establishment Code**: A unique identifier assigned by the SAT to each "
"business establishment, which is required for electronic invoicing."
msgstr ""
"**施設コード**\\ ：SATが各事業所に割り当てる一意の識別子で、電子インボイスに"
"必要です。"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/guatemala.rst:58
msgid ""
"**Quetzal**: The official currency of Guatemala, represented by the symbol "
"GTQ. This is the base currency for all financial transactions in the "
"Guatemalan localization."
msgstr ""
"**ケツァル**\\ ：グアテマラの公式通貨で、記号GTQで表されます。これはグアテマ"
"ラローカライゼーションにおけるすべての金融取引の基本通貨です。"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/guatemala.rst:67
msgid ""
":ref:`Install <general/install>` the following modules to get all the "
"features of the Guatemalan localization:"
msgstr ""
"グアテマラローカライゼーションのすべての機能を利用するには、次のモジュール"
"を:ref:`インストール <general/install>`\\ してください："

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/guatemala.rst:77
msgid ":guilabel:`Guatemala - Accounting`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`グアテマラ - 会計`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/guatemala.rst:78
msgid "`l10n_gt`"
msgstr "`l10n_gt`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/guatemala.rst:79
msgid ""
"The default :doc:`fiscal localization package <../fiscal_localizations>`. It "
"adds accounting characteristics for the Guatemalan localization, which "
"represent the minimum configuration required for a company to operate in "
"Guatemala according to the guidelines set by the |SAT|. The module's "
"installation automatically loads the chart of accounts and taxes."
msgstr ""
"デフォルトの:doc:`会計ローカライゼーションパッケージ <../"
"fiscal_localizations>`\\ 。グアテマラローカライゼーションの会計特性を追加"
"し、|SAT|\\ が定めたガイドラインに従ってグアテマラで事業を行うために必要な最"
"小限の構成を表します。モジュールのインストールにより、勘定科目表と税が自動的"
"に読み込まれます。"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/guatemala.rst:83
msgid ":guilabel:`Guatemala Accounting EDI`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`グアテマラ会計EDI`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/guatemala.rst:84
msgid "`l10n_gt_edi`"
msgstr "`l10n_gt_edi`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/guatemala.rst:85
msgid ""
"Includes all the technical and functional requirements to generate and "
"validate :doc:`Electronics Documents <../accounting/customer_invoices/"
"electronic_invoicing>`, based on the technical documentation published by "
"the |SAT|. The authorized documents are :ref:`listed above <guatemala/"
"intro>`."
msgstr ""
"|SAT|\\ が公開した技術文書に基づいて、:doc:`電子ドキュメント <../accounting/"
"customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing>`\\ を生成および検証するためのすべての"
"技術的および機能的要件が含まれています。承認されたドキュメントは:ref:`上記に"
"記載 <guatemala/intro>`\\ されています。"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/guatemala.rst:91
msgid ""
"Odoo automatically installs the base module **Guatemala - Accounting** when "
"a database is installed with `Guatemala` selected as the country. However, "
"to enable electronic invoicing, the **Guatemala Accounting EDI** "
"(`l10n_gt_edi`) module needs to be manually :ref:`installed <general/"
"install>`."
msgstr ""
"データベースのインストール時に国として `Guatemala` が選択されると、Odooは基本"
"モジュール **グアテマラ - 会計** を自動的にインストールします。ただし、電子イ"
"ンボイスを有効にするには、**グアテマラ会計EDI** (`l10n_gt_edi`) モジュールを"
"手動で:ref:`インストール <general/install>`\\ する必要があります。"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/guatemala.rst:99
#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:41
#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/uruguay.rst:83
msgid ""
"To configure your company information, open the **Settings** app, scroll "
"down to the :guilabel:`Companies` section, click :guilabel:`Update Info`, "
"and configure the following:"
msgstr ""
"会社情報を設定するには、**設定**\\ アプリを開き、:guilabel:`会社`\\ セクショ"
"ンまでスクロールして、:guilabel:`情報を更新`\\ をクリックし、次の項目を設定し"
"ます："

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/guatemala.rst:103
#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/guatemala.rst:193
#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:45
#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/uruguay.rst:87
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Address`, including "
"the :guilabel:`Street`, :guilabel:`City`, :guilabel:`State`, :guilabel:`ZIP`, "
"and :guilabel:`Country`"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`住所`\\ （:guilabel:`住所1`\\ 、:guilabel:`市区町村"
"`\\ 、:guilabel:`都道府県・州`\\ 、:guilabel:`郵便番号`\\ 、:guilabel:`国`\\ "
"を含む）"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/guatemala.rst:105
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Tax ID`: Enter the identification number for the selected "
"taxpayer type."
msgstr ":guilabel:`税ID`\\ ：選択した納税者タイプの識別番号を入力します。"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/guatemala.rst:106
msgid ""
":guilabel:`VAT Affiliation`: Select the VAT affiliation for the company, "
"which is the type of Regime the company belongs to."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`VAT加盟`\\ ：会社のVAT加盟を選択します。これは会社が属する体制のタ"
"イプです。"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/guatemala.rst:108
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Legal Name`: The legal name of the company, which is used in the "
"XML and PDF documents."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`正式氏名`\\ ：会社の正式名称で、XMLおよびPDFドキュメントで使用され"
"ます。"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/guatemala.rst:109
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Establishment Code`: A necessary part of the XML when creating an "
"electronic document. If this field is not set, all electronic documents will "
"be rejected."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`施設コード`\\ ：電子ドキュメントを作成する際にXMLに必要な部分で"
"す。このフィールドが設定されていない場合、すべての電子ドキュメントが拒否され"
"ます。"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/guatemala.rst:112
msgid ""
"To locate the :guilabel:`Establishment Code` in your `SAT account <https://"
"portal.sat.gob.gt/>`_, go to :menuselection:`FEL --> Administración de "
"Establecimientos`. The list of registered establishments is displayed along "
"with their corresponding codes."
msgstr ""
"`SATアカウント <https://portal.sat.gob.gt/>`_\\ で:guilabel:`施設コード`\\ を"
"確認するには、:menuselection:`FEL --> Administración de Establecimientos`\\ "
"に移動します。登録された施設のリストが対応するコードとともに表示されます。"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/guatemala.rst:117
msgid ""
"After configuring the company in the database settings, navigate to the "
"company's contact form and verify that the :guilabel:`Identification "
"Number` :guilabel:`Type` is set to :guilabel:`NIT`."
msgstr ""
"データベース設定で会社を設定した後、会社の連絡先フォームに移動し、:guilabel:`"
"識別番号`\\ の:guilabel:`タイプ`\\ が:guilabel:`NIT`\\ に設定されていることを"
"確認します。"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/guatemala.rst:121
msgid "Electronic invoicing credentials"
msgstr "電子請求書の認証情報"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/guatemala.rst:123
msgid ""
"In Guatemala, electronic invoicing is mandatory for most businesses. Odoo "
"connects with the authorized provider, Infile, to generate and submit "
"electronic documents to the |SAT| for validation."
msgstr ""
"グアテマラでは、ほとんどの企業にとって電子請求書は必須です。Odooは認可された"
"プロバイダーであるInfileと接続し、電子ドキュメントを生成して検証のために|SAT|"
"に提出します。"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/guatemala.rst:127
msgid ""
"Before issuing electronic documents, you must configure and connect Odoo to "
"Infile to ensure they are properly validated and assigned an official |UUID|."
msgstr ""
"電子ドキュメントを発行する前に、OdooをInfileに設定して接続し、適切に検証され"
"公式の|UUID|が割り当てられるようにする必要があります。"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/guatemala.rst:131
msgid "Infile"
msgstr "Infile"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/guatemala.rst:133
msgid ""
"Sign a service agreement directly with `Infile <https://infile.com.gt/>`_. "
"Infile will then provide the necessary credentials to input in Odoo."
msgstr ""
"`Infile <https://infile.com.gt/>`_\\ と直接サービス契約を締結してください。そ"
"の後、InfileがOdooに入力する必要な認証情報を提供します。"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/guatemala.rst:137
msgid ""
"To create an Infile account and benefit from the **8% discount** available "
"for Odoo customers, fill out the: `Infile Registration Form <https://"
"share.hsforms.com/1HksZ6i1VRRWHRhXPvYZORQrwu2r>`_. An Infile agent will "
"contact you to help you complete the onboarding process and sign the service "
"agreement."
msgstr ""
"Infileアカウントを作成し、Odoo顧客向けに利用可能な\\ **8%割引**\\ を受けるに"
"は、`Infile登録フォーム <https://share.hsforms.com/"
"1HksZ6i1VRRWHRhXPvYZORQrwu2r>`_ に記入してください。Infileエージェントが連絡"
"し、オンボーディングプロセスの完了とサービス契約の署名をサポートします。"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/guatemala.rst:142
