"ストール <general/install>`できます。"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/philippines.rst:39
msgid ""
"The Philippine localization package ensures compliance with Philippine "
"fiscal and accounting regulations. It includes tools for managing taxes, "
"fiscal positions, reporting, and a predefined chart of accounts tailored to "
"the Philippines' standards."
msgstr ""
"フィリピンのローカライゼーションパッケージは、フィリピンの財務および会計規制"
"への準拠を保証します。税金、会計ポジション、レポーティングを管理するための"
"ツールと、フィリピンの基準に合わせた事前定義された勘定科目表が含まれていま"
"す。"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/philippines.rst:43
msgid ""
"The Philippine localization package provides the following key features to "
"ensure compliance with local fiscal and accounting regulations:"
msgstr ""
"フィリピンのローカライゼーションパッケージは、地域の財務および会計規制への準"
"拠を保証するために、次の主要機能を提供します:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/philippines.rst:46
msgid ""
":doc:`../accounting/get_started/chart_of_accounts`: a predefined structure "
"tailored to Philippine accounting standards"
msgstr ""
":doc:`../accounting/get_started/chart_of_accounts`: フィリピンの会計基準に合"
"わせた事前定義された構造"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/philippines.rst:48
msgid ""
":ref:`localizations/philippines/taxes`: pre-configured tax rates, including "
"standard VAT, zero-rated, and exempt options"
msgstr ""
":ref:`localizations/philippines/taxes`: 標準VAT、ゼロ税率、免税オプションを含"
"む事前設定された税率"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/philippines.rst:52
msgid ""
":ref:`Tax reporting <localizations/philippines/tax-reporting>`: detailed "
"overview of your net tax liability"
msgstr ""
":ref:`税務レポーティング <localizations/philippines/tax-reporting>`: 純税務負"
"債の詳細な概要"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/philippines.rst:60
msgid ""
"Installing the :guilabel:`Philippines - Accounting` (`l10n_ph`) "
"and :guilabel:`Philippines - Accounting Reports` (`l10n_ph_reports`) modules "
"automatically creates default :doc:`taxes <../accounting/taxes>` "
"for :ref:`tax reports <localizations/philippines/tax-reporting>` generation. "
"The following categories are linked to the relevant accounts:"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Philippines - Accounting`（`l10n_ph`）および"
"\\ :guilabel:`Philippines - Accounting Reports`（`l10n_ph_reports`）モジュー"
"ルをインストールすると、:ref:`税務レポート <localizations/philippines/tax-"
"reporting>`生成用のデフォルト:doc:`税金 <../accounting/taxes>`が自動的に作成"
"されます。次のカテゴリが関連する勘定にリンクされています:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/philippines.rst:65
msgid ":guilabel:`Sales and Purchase VAT`: 12%"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Sales and Purchase VAT`: 12%"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/philippines.rst:66
msgid ":guilabel:`Sales and Purchase VAT Zero-Rated`: 0%"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Sales and Purchase VAT Zero-Rated`: 0%"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/philippines.rst:67
msgid ":guilabel:`Sales and Purchase VAT Exempt`: Exempt"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Sales and Purchase VAT Exempt`: 免税"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/philippines.rst:68
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Withholding Tax`: Expanded Withholding Tax (EWHT), Final "
"Withholding Tax (FWHT), and Withholding VAT (WVAT)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Withholding Tax`: 拡張源泉徴収税（EWHT）、最終源泉徴収税（FWHT）、"
"源泉徴収VAT（WVAT）"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/philippines.rst:72
msgid ""
"Default taxes are pre-configured and mapped to the relevant reports. To "
"create a new tax, it is recommended to **duplicate** an existing one to "
"preserve this configuration. To do so, select the tax, click :icon:`fa-"
"cog` :guilabel:`Actions`, and select :guilabel:`Duplicate`."
msgstr ""
"デフォルトの税金は事前設定され、関連するレポートにマッピングされています。新"
"しい税金を作成するには、この設定を保持するために既存の税金を**複製**すること"
"をお勧めします。これを行うには、税金を選択し、:icon:`fa-"
"cog`\\ :guilabel:`Actions`\\ をクリックして、:guilabel:`Duplicate`\\ を選択し"
"ます。"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/philippines.rst:79
msgid "ATC codes"
msgstr "ATCコード"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/philippines.rst:81
msgid ""
"ATC codes are essential for generating :ref:`BIR 2307 <localizations/"
"philippines/reports/bir2307>`, :ref:`localizations/philippines/reports/"
"sawt_qap` reports. These codes ensure compliance with regulatory "
"requirements."
msgstr ""
"ATCコードは、:ref:`BIR 2307 <localizations/philippines/reports/"
"bir2307>`、:ref:`localizations/philippines/reports/sawt_qap`\\ レポートの生成"
"に不可欠です。これらのコードは、規制要件への準拠を保証します。"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/philippines.rst:85
msgid ""
"To configure a withholding tax, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> "
"Configuration --> Taxes`, select the tax, and fill in "
"the :guilabel:`Philippines ATC` (Alphanumeric Tax Code) field under "
"the :guilabel:`Philippines` tab."
msgstr ""
"源泉徴収税を設定するには、:menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> "
"Taxes`\\ に移動し、税金を選択して、:guilabel:`Philippines`\\ タブの下の"
"\\ :guilabel:`Philippines ATC`（英数字税コード）フィールドに入力します。"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/philippines.rst:97
msgid "2550Q"
msgstr "2550Q"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/philippines.rst:99
msgid ""
"The **BIR Form 2550Q** summarizes sales, purchases, output VAT, input VAT, "
"and the resulting VAT payable or refundable for the period."
msgstr ""
"**BIR Form 2550Q**\\ は、期間の売上、仕入、出力VAT、入力VAT、および結果として"
"生じる支払VAT または還付可能VAT を要約します。"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/philippines.rst:102
msgid ""
"To access it, navigate to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Reporting --> Tax "
"Report`, click :icon:`fa-book` :guilabel:`Report`, and "
"select :guilabel:`2550Q (PH)`."
msgstr ""
"アクセスするには、:menuselection:`会計 --> レポーティング --> Tax Report`に移"
"動し、:icon:`fa-book` :guilabel:`レポート`をクリックして、:guilabel:`2550Q "
"(PH)`を選択します。"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/philippines.rst:108
msgid "SAWT and QAP"
msgstr "SAWTとQAP"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/philippines.rst:110
msgid ""
"To access these reports, navigate to :menuselection:`Accounting --> "
"Reporting --> Tax Report`, click :icon:`fa-book` :guilabel:`Report`, and "
"select :guilabel:`SAWT & QAP (PH)`."
msgstr ""
"これらのレポートにアクセスするには、:menuselection:`会計 --> レポーティング "
"--> Tax Report`に移動し、:icon:`fa-book` :guilabel:`レポート`をクリックし"
"て、:guilabel:`SAWT & QAP (PH)`を選択します。"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/philippines.rst:113
msgid ""
"**Summary of Alphalist of Withholding Taxes (SAWT)**: Displays all customer "
"invoices that have sales withholding taxes applied. This export is used as a "
"supporting document for forms **1701Q**, **1701**, **1702Q**, and **1702**."
msgstr ""
"**Summary of Alphalist of Withholding Taxes (SAWT)**:販売源泉徴収税が適用され"
"たすべての顧客請求書を表示します。このエクスポートは、フォーム**1701Q**、"
"**1701**、**1702Q**、**1702**の補助ドキュメントとして使用されます。"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/philippines.rst:116
msgid ""
"**Quarterly Alphalist of Payees (QAP)**: Includes all vendor bills that have "
"purchase withholding taxes applied. This export is used as a supporting "
"document for forms **1601EQ** and **1604E**."
msgstr ""
"**Quarterly Alphalist of Payees (QAP)**:購買源泉徴収税が適用されたすべての仕"
"入先請求書を含みます。このエクスポートは、フォーム**1601EQ**と**1604E**の補助"
"ドキュメントとして使用されます。"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/philippines.rst:121
msgid ""
"The generated file is based on the specific **period** selected in the "
"calendar report filter. For example, while the **1601EQ** is a quarterly "
"report, `.DAT` files are submitted monthly. Make sure to filter "
"by :guilabel:`Month` and select the appropriate month before exporting."
msgstr ""
"生成されるファイルは、カレンダーレポートフィルタで選択された特定の**期間**に"
"基づきます。たとえば、**1601EQ**は四半期レポートですが、`.DAT`ファイルは月次"
"で提出されます。エクスポートする前に、:guilabel:`月`でフィルタし、適切な月を"
"選択してください。"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/philippines.rst:125
msgid ""
"Both SAWT and QAP reports can be exported in `.DAT` format, which is "
"compatible with the BIR :abbr:`Alpha (Alphalist Data Entry and Validation)` "
"module. To do so, follow these steps:"
msgstr ""
"SAWTとQAPの両方のレポートは、BIR :abbr:`Alpha (Alphalist Data Entry and "
"Validation)`モジュールと互換性のある`.DAT`形式でエクスポートできます。これを"
"行うには、次の手順に従ってください:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/philippines.rst:128
#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/philippines.rst:159
msgid "Make sure to filter by the appropriate month."
msgstr "適切な月でフィルタしてください。"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/philippines.rst:129
msgid ""
"On the report page, click the :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(gear)` icon and "
"select :guilabel:`Export SAWT & QAP`."
msgstr ""
"レポートページで、:icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(歯車)`アイコンをクリック"
"し、:guilabel:`Export SAWT & QAP`を選択します。"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/philippines.rst:131
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`DAT Export Options` window, choose the "
"relevant :guilabel:`Attachment For (e.g., 1601EQ)` and "
"click :guilabel:`Export`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`DAT Export Options`ウィンドウで、関連する:guilabel:`Attachment "
"For (例: 1601EQ)`を選択し、:guilabel:`エクスポート`をクリックします。"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/philippines.rst:137
msgid "SLSP"
msgstr "SLSP"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/philippines.rst:139
msgid ""
"The **SLSP (Summary lists of sales and purchases)** is an electronic "
"schedule required from VAT‑registered taxpayers listing sales and purchase "
"transactions."
msgstr ""
"**SLSP (Summary lists of sales and purchases)**は、VAT登録納税者に義務付けら"
"れている電子スケジュールで、販売および購買打刻データをリストします。"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/philippines.rst:142
msgid ""
"To access it, navigate to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Reporting --> "
"Summary Lists of Sales and Purchases`."
msgstr ""
"アクセスするには、:menuselection:`会計 --> レポーティング --> Summary Lists "
"of Sales and Purchases`に移動します。"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/philippines.rst:145
msgid ""
"**Summary List of Sales (SLS)**: Detailed sales per customer with amounts "
"and output VAT."
msgstr "**Summary List of Sales (SLS)**:顧客ごとの詳細な販売金額と消費税額。"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/philippines.rst:146
msgid ""
"**Summary List of Purchases (SLP)**: Detailed purchases per supplier with "
"amounts and input VAT."
msgstr ""
"**Summary List of Purchases (SLP)**:仕入先ごとの詳細な購買金額と仕入税額。"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/philippines.rst:149
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Summary List of Purchases` report excludes imports by "
"default. To include import transactions, click :icon:`fa-"
"sliders` :guilabel:`Posted Entries` and select :guilabel:`Including "
"Importations`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Summary List of Purchases`レポートは、デフォルトで輸入を除外しま"
"す。輸入打刻データを含めるには、:icon:`fa-sliders` :guilabel:`Posted Entries`"
"をクリックし、:guilabel:`Including Importations`を選択します。"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/philippines.rst:152
msgid ""
"The generated file is based on the specific **period** selected in the "
"calendar report filter. For example, while the **2550Q** is a quarterly "
"report, `.DAT` files are submitted monthly. Make sure to filter "
"by :guilabel:`Month` and select the appropriate month before exporting."
msgstr ""
"生成されるファイルは、カレンダーレポートフィルタで選択された特定の**期間**に"
"基づきます。たとえば、**2550Q**は四半期レポートですが、`.DAT`ファイルは月次で"
"提出されます。エクスポートする前に、:guilabel:`月`でフィルタし、適切な月を選"
"択してください。"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/philippines.rst:156
msgid ""
"SLS and SLP reports can be exported in `.DAT` format, which is compatible "
"with the :abbr:`ReLiEf (Reconciliation of Listings for Enforcement)` module. "
"To do so, follow these steps:"
msgstr ""
"SLSとSLPのレポートは、:abbr:`ReLiEf (Reconciliation of Listings for "
"Enforcement)`モジュールと互換性のある`.DAT`形式でエクスポートできます。これを"
"行うには、次の手順に従ってください:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/philippines.rst:160
msgid ""
"On the report page, click the :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(gear)` icon and "
"select :guilabel:`Export SLSP`."
msgstr ""
"レポートページで、:icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(歯車)`アイコンをクリック"
"し、:guilabel:`Export SLSP`を選択します。"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/philippines.rst:162
msgid "In the :guilabel:`DAT Export Options` window, click :guilabel:`Export`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`DAT Export Options`ウィンドウで、:guilabel:`エクスポート`をクリッ"
"クします。"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/philippines.rst:167
msgid "BIR 2307"
msgstr "BIR 2307"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/philippines.rst:169
msgid ""
"The **BIR 2307**, or *Certificate of Creditable Tax Withheld at Source*, can "
"be generated for :guilabel:`vendor bills` that include expanded withholding "
"taxes."
msgstr ""
"**BIR 2307**\\ または\\ *源泉徴収税額控除証明書*\\ は、拡大源泉徴収税を含む"
"\\ :guilabel:`仕入先請求書`\\ に対して生成できます。"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/philippines.rst:172
msgid "To generate a BIR 2307 report:"
msgstr "BIR 2307レポートを生成するには："

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/philippines.rst:174
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Vendors --> Bills` and select one or "
"multiple vendor bills from the list view."
msgstr ""
":menuselection:`会計 --> 仕入先 --> 仕入先請求書`\\ に移動し、リストビューか"
"ら1つまたは複数の仕入先請求書を選択します。"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/philippines.rst:176
msgid ""
"Click :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`Actions`, and select :guilabel:`Download BIR "
"2307 XLS`."
msgstr ""
":icon:`fa-cog`\\ :guilabel:`アクション`\\ をクリックし、:guilabel:`BIR 2307 "
"XLSをダウンロード`\\ を選択します。"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/philippines.rst:177
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`BIR 2307 Report` window, review the selection and "
"click :guilabel:`Generate`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`BIR 2307レポート`\\ ウィンドウで、選択内容を確認し、:guilabel:`生"
"成`\\ をクリックします。"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/philippines.rst:180
msgid ""
"The XLS file generates records **only** for bill lines with **expanded "
"withholding taxes** applied."
msgstr ""
"XLSファイルは、**拡大源泉徴収税**が適用された請求書明細行の記録\\ **のみ**\\ "
"を生成します。"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/philippines.rst:184
msgid ""
"Odoo does not generate the BIR 2307 PDF report natively. The exported "
"`Form_2307.xls` file must be converted to BIR DAT or PDF format."
msgstr ""
"Odooはネイティブでは BIR 2307 PDFレポートを生成しません。エクスポートされた "
"`Form_2307.xls` ファイルは、BIR DAT または PDF 形式に変換する必要があります。"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/philippines.rst:201
msgid "In the :guilabel:`Street 2` field, enter the barangay."
msgstr ":guilabel:`番地2`\\ フィールドに、バランガイを入力します。"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/philippines.rst:203
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Tax ID`: Taxpayer Identification Number (TIN) should follow the "
"`NNN-NNN-NNN-NNNNN` format"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`税ID`：納税者番号(TIN)は `NNN-NNN-NNN-NNNNN` 形式に従う必要があり"
"ます"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/philippines.rst:205
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Company Branch code` uses the last 3 to 5 digits of "
"the :guilabel:`Tax ID`, or defaults to `000` if not provided."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`会社支店コード`\\ は、:guilabel:`税ID`\\ の末尾3~5桁を使用するか、"
"入力されていない場合はデフォルトで `000` になります。"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/philippines.rst:207
msgid ":guilabel:`RDO`: Revenue District Office code."
msgstr ":guilabel:`RDO`：歳入管区事務所コード。"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/philippines.rst:216
msgid ""
"The Philippine localization utilizes specific fields on contact forms to "
"generate :abbr:`BIR (Bureau of Internal Revenue)` reports and files used for "
"submission."
msgstr ""
"フィリピンのローカライゼーションは、連絡先フォームの特定のフィールドを使用し"
"て、提出に使用される\\ :abbr:`BIR(内国歳入庁)`\\ レポートとファイルを生成しま"
"す。"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/philippines.rst:219
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Tax ID` field is used to register the :abbr:`TIN (tax "
"identification number)` for both companies and individuals. Filling in this "
"field is recommended to ensure the accuracy of :ref:`tax reports "
"<localizations/philippines/reports/slsp>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`税ID`\\ フィールドは、企業と個人の両方について\\ :abbr:`TIN(納税者"
"番号)`\\ を登録するために使用されます。:ref:`税務レポート <localizations/"
"philippines/reports/slsp>`\\ の正確性を確保するため、このフィールドへの入力を"
"推奨します。"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/philippines.rst:223
msgid ""
"For individuals not associated with a company, use the following additional "
"fields to identify them:"
msgstr ""
"企業に所属していない個人については、以下の追加フィールドを使用して識別しま"
